Cell["2. Evolution", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"8771c75d-c4da-f64b-bdc0-fda514ec1873"],

Cell["\<\
Every edge of every state is a place the subdivision rule fits, so each \
generation has one more edge to work on than the last:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ed968f7f-672d-4044-88bf-693ed6558a32"],

