Cell["7. Seeing it", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"4575229c-75ae-b041-a3d2-00bea77f3854"],

Cell["\<\
Everything above has been counts and lists of numbered events. A graph of a \
rewriting system is meant to be looked at, and every graph-valued property \
draws its states and its events as pictures.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3aa9165e-9372-7b4e-83ff-e584ef2263d8"],

Cell["A rule, and an event", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"eec19173-fe0c-194e-a7d1-f7318a15cef7"],

Cell["\<\
A rule is its input beside its output, with the vertices the two sides share \
in the same places, so that what the rule does to them can be read off rather \
than worked out. The vertex it creates is highlighted:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d6ff7e53-28e2-dd4a-be42-19f8eaafd5eb"],

Cell["HypergraphRulePlot[subdivide, \"PanelSize\" -> 130]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"de5aaf00-74b3-1a41-9a03-7788e974a604"],

