Cell["Holding options on the system", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"542deb10-33d2-274d-a837-f751d129713d"],

Cell["\<\
A system can carry the options that describe it, so they are not retyped on \
every call:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"650c6f3a-ec8a-b84b-b44b-17e50b405e8c"],

Cell["\<\
strict = HypergraphRewritingSystem[subdivide, Hypergraph[{{1, 2}, {2, 3}}],
  \"CausalDependence\" -> \"Edges\", \"PanelSize\" -> 70];
strict\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"5d926c65-53e8-9142-9f06-e33738aca32f"],

